        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo kuchikyï nyinte ntökïlalïyan, kïpïstö chane kïpa. Kïpa pïchay cho le 50 kïyarata Eliya kïghömï kutïngkot nko mpöghoghöy ompö osis sömök, wölo kimönyorïcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïmïlisyö wölay kimi Elisya nyo kiköngöy chane ompö Yeriko. Kïlenchï Elisya pïchay, “Olentan kataghenakwa lö mapa?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Töngönchintin cho kigh Elisya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpa pipö Yeriko wölo mi Elisya akïlenchï, “Pïchigh tya kanasyantanï, le otini isïwïyenyi echotyon, wölo ghach pöghechi amöminye kïgh nyo rïro kore.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö, “Opkanïn tïwan nyo tökïrel, ayin partin.” Kepchï tïwan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kïwö kutang köyay pö pögh akïlösyï partinechay kïlentöy, “Mwoghöy ECHOTYON lö, ‘Kosopön pöghechï, melö tökwighöy pich ngat kïmeghyot anta igh kor mörïrö tïkwïn.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïsil pöghechay kïngata atoni kïrïp kegh nko ngölyonto Elisya nyo kimwowï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïweghö Elisya Yeriko kutang Petel, otini kitökïmi kïtuyö nko karachïna cho kipkono kanasyan, kïroröchï nyinte ompöwölo kipechate möt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïwaghaka akïchïp chane ompö kaynata ECHOTYON. Kïpkana koghyenï odeny wuw cho sökote akïpar karachïnechay cho le 42.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.2.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
